{"id":"gram_b2_0016","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","area":"grammar","point":"despite + -ing","topic":"sports","model":"Cambridge B2 First – multiple-choice cloze","format":"mc","prompt":"Despite ____ injured, he played the whole match.","options":["he was","of being","to be","being"],"key":3,"traps":["'despite' no va seguido de una oración con sujeto y verbo","'despite' no lleva 'of' (eso es 'in spite of')","no va infinitivo"]},
