{"id":"gram_b2_0020","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","area":"vocabulary","point":"word formation: noun from verb","topic":"work","model":"Cambridge B2 First – word formation","format":"mc","prompt":"The ____ of the new software took three months.","options":["develop","developer","developed","development"],"key":3,"traps":["verbo, no sustantivo","es la persona, no el proceso","participio, no sustantivo"]},
{"id":"gram_b2_0021","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","area":"grammar","point":"participle clauses","topic":"daily life","model":"Cambridge B2 First – multiple-choice cloze","format":"mc","prompt":"____ the door, she realised she had left her keys inside.","options":["Closing","Closed","To close","Having close"],"key":0,"traps":["participio pasivo: la puerta, no ella","propósito, no simultaneidad","falta el participio: sería 'Having closed'"]},
{"id":"gram_b2_0022","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","area":"grammar","point":"whereas (contrast)","topic":"family","model":"Cambridge B2 First – multiple-choice cloze","format":"mc","prompt":"My brother loves the city, ____ I prefer living in the countryside.","options":["despite","whereas","however","because"],"key":1,"traps":["'despite' no va seguido de una oración","'however' necesita punto o punto y coma antes","no expresa contraste"]},
{"id":"gram_b2_0023","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","area":"vocabulary","point":"false friend: eventually","topic":"work","model":"Cambridge B2 First – multiple-choice cloze","format":"mc","prompt":"After months of waiting, she ____ got the promotion she wanted.","options":["eventual","possibly","eventually","occasionally"],"key":2,"traps":["adjetivo, no adverbio","'possibly' es 'quizás': no indica 'al final'","falso amigo: 'occasionally' es 'de vez en cuando'"]},
{"id":"gram_b2_0024","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","area":"grammar","point":"mixed conditional (past → present)","topic":"studies","model":"Cambridge B2 First – multiple-choice cloze","format":"mc","prompt":"If I had studied medicine, I ____ a doctor now.","options":["would have been","will be","had been","would be"],"key":3,"traps":["'now' indica resultado presente: no va 'would have been'","futuro: no es hipotético","no es el resultado de la condición"]},
